<title>UK: Eurotunnel Sept traffic rises.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel Sept traffic rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel said its Le Shuttle service rose to 219,009 vehicles in September from 105,914 a year ago.</p>
<p>It said 486,966 passengers were carried during the month, up from 293,502 in September 1995.</p>
<p>In a statement, the group said the tunnel saw 207,235 tonnes of railfreight moved, up from 157,473 tonnes previously.</p>
</text>
